{"id":"truco","lemma":"truco","pos":"noun","rank":1321,"glosses":["gimmick, ploy (something designed to fool or swindle)","piece of a magician's act","effective way of doing something"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾuko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trucos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-truco.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es un truco.","en":"That's a gimmick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443671","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"¿Dónde está el truco?","en":"Where's the catch?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75838","words":[null,null,{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"where are you?"]]},{"text":"Ese truco yo no lo sabía.","en":"I didn't know that trick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531849","words":[{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"}]},{"text":"Entrené al perro para que haga trucos.","en":"I trained the dog to do tricks.","words":[{"g":"to train","l":"entrenar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"dog"},null,null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"so that"]]},{"text":"Ella le enseñó los trucos del negocio.","en":"She taught him the tricks of the trade.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to teach","l":"enseñar"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"business, enterprise"}]}]}